  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 23.28,
      "e": 29.28,
      "text": "When I was driving in this morning, I was looking at the sunrise, I was looking at the sky, it was a beautiful day."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.28,
      "e": 35.28,
      "text": "And I couldn't help but reflect on this day ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.28,
      "e": 44.28,
      "text": "I couldn't help but reflect on that ten years ago today in the Launch Control Center, at Kennedy Space Center,"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.28,
      "e": 57.28,
      "text": "and in our, in firing room four, in firing room two, many members of this team gathered for the final launch of the Space Shuttle Program."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.28,
      "e": 65.28,
      "text": "We have not been together like that since then, ten years later, here we are."
    },
    {
      "s": 65.28,
      "e": 76.28,
      "text": "And to me it seems fitting that on this day that we kind of passed that baton from the Shuttle Program to the Artemis Program, as we are not at the end of it."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.28,
      "e": 81.28,
      "text": "The Shuttle was at the end on July 8th, but we are at the beginning."
    },
    {
      "s": 81.28,
      "e": 86.28,
      "text": "The beginning of a new era, a new era for this team and a new era for our nation in exploration."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.28,
      "e": 91.28,
      "text": "And so today I welcome our teammates at Johnson."
    },
    {
      "s": 91.28,
      "e": 102.28,
      "text": "I welcome our team back here. Our teammates at Marshall, our sister programs, SLS, Orion, and our flight control team with us today."
    },
    {
      "s": 102.28,
      "e": 115.28,
      "text": "I encourage everyone to please take notes of things that work well and things that maybe didn't work so well because this is our opportunity to bring those things out of the issues with calm, issues in our procedures."
    },
    {
      "s": 115.28,
      "e": 119.28,
      "text": "Whatever those things are, this is the first time we've had our big team together."
    }
  ],
